0000083a  ; 0000083a..00000841  8 bytes the analysis never reached

; snd_vol_tables: An array of 65 volume tables of 256 bytes, 0x842..0x4941 (0x4100 bytes). The base
;   of level v is 0x842 + v*0x100 with v = 0..64, and the transform is table_v[i] = 0x80 +
;   trunc((i-128)*v/64) with truncation towards zero. v=0 is silence (all 0x80) and v=64 is the
;   identity. Linear volume in 65 steps of 1/64.
snd_vol_tables:
00000842  ; 00000842..00004841  16384 bytes the analysis never reached

; snd_vol_full: Maximum volume table (v=64), which is the identity d[0x4842+i] = i. It is the one
;   the reset puts into all six voices.
